.TH HANOI 1
.SH NAME
hanoi \- Towers of Hanoi animation
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/hanoi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Hanoi
implements Towers of Hanoi animation.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Six disks move automatically among three poles. Enter restarts the animation.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B Enter / r
Restart animation
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/hanoi.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR wm (1)
